import BipartiteDD.Haar.CycLift.Lift

/-! The (3,14) graph on 5706 vertices: a regular `Z_317` voltage lift of a 18-vertex cubic base graph.

Edge list: `research/frontier/beyond/graphs/d3D14_n5706_lift_pappus_Z317.edges.gz`
(uncompressed sha256 `fd460a47630982cbf4b3b472f4b31155f7ed3d41e72b3a480e32da14a30894bf`).
Base vertex `w` and fibre `x` give the vertex `w * 317 + x`. `outA5706` lists, for each base vertex `w`, the arcs
`(u, β)`: `(w, x) ~ (u, x + β)`. Generated by `research/lean-haarD/gen_cyclift.py`, which checks that this formula
gives exactly the edges of the file, and that the graph has diameter 14 by a BFS from every vertex. -/

